  "details": "When a parent constraint has \"Freeze To World\" enabled in the scene, and then previewing an animation that turns that property off and on and potentially moves the location the object is frozen to, exiting animation preview while the property is turned on keeps it frozen at the new location, this can break the initial behavior of some systems, and while I haven't tested it yet I fear the issue is exaggerated when \"Rebake Offsets When Unfrozen\" is used.",
